京东-159913.description:
1. Be responsible of offering an amazing shopping experience by categorizing & sorting the assortment based on user needs;
2. Build strong relationships with suppliers and execute negotiations to ensure best commercial conditions;
3. Analyze key metrics and identify sourcing gaps to derive strategies on how to improve supplier and category performance;
4. Promotions management and cross-selling opportunities, working closer with brand activation team to implement campaigns
5. Dynamic pricing execution and analysis;
6. Engage with regional and local teams to implement strategies proposed.

京东-159913.requirements:
1. 5+ years of experience in the Retail/eCommerce sector in Category Management, Buying and/or Trade Marketing;
2. A strong understanding of the NL market - and a willingness to disrupt the way it currently operates;
3. Negotiation skills that not only achieve the best-in-class product margins and customer offer, but also inspire the rest of the team to continuously become better negotiators;
4. Highly enthusiastic and entrepreneurial and want to take ownership of responsibilities and show a real drive to get things done at pace;
5. Have excellent communication and problem solving skills, a natural ability to work with data and draw insights from it that put into plans;
6. Ability to learn fast and implement strategies, and analyze data for insights which demonstrate the attitude/senses of an entrepreneur to achieve results; Fluent in English.

